WEBVTT

01:05.148 --> 01:06.024
Excuse me.

01:08.860 --> 01:10.320
BASED ON WEBTOON TRUE BEAUTY
BY YAONGYI

01:15.200 --> 01:16.159
Thank you, sir.

01:16.826 --> 01:17.702
It’s my pleasure.

01:24.209 --> 01:25.502
Miss!

01:25.585 --> 01:27.921
Where have you been all alone?

01:28.004 --> 01:30.507
I've been looking for you everywhere.
Come on, let's go.

01:36.513 --> 01:38.556
Young Master!

01:40.308 --> 01:41.810
Do you know that woman's name?

01:42.685 --> 01:43.895
Judging from her servant,

01:43.978 --> 01:46.147
I believe that's the daughter
of the Lim family.

01:46.648 --> 01:48.483
The daughter of the Lim family, you say.

01:50.276 --> 01:52.153
Her hands looked soft and smooth as silk.

01:52.946 --> 01:54.447
Imagine how lovely her face must be.

01:57.617 --> 01:58.952
I must write a love letter.

01:59.035 --> 02:00.453
A love letter?

02:13.216 --> 02:14.509
Welcome.

02:15.593 --> 02:17.929
I'd like to see the items
from this end to that end.

02:18.012 --> 02:19.055
All of them.

02:19.139 --> 02:21.015
All of these?

02:21.099 --> 02:22.725
Yes, all of them.

02:22.809 --> 02:24.769
- Looking for a birthday gift?
- No.

02:26.104 --> 02:27.981
I have to ask someone out right away.

02:31.359 --> 02:32.277
Tell her how I feel.

02:32.360 --> 02:35.238
GOING TO ASK HER OUT RIGHT AWAY

02:38.700 --> 02:39.659
So you're saying

02:39.742 --> 02:43.454
those two guys are friends
who fell for the same girl?

02:43.538 --> 02:44.581
That's right.

02:44.664 --> 02:47.208
But that one liked her first.

02:47.292 --> 02:50.003
He told the other one she was his
and not to approach her.

02:50.837 --> 02:53.214
What? Then why is he doing all that now?

02:53.298 --> 02:55.675
Didn't he approach her for revenge?

02:55.758 --> 02:59.429
He supposedly fell in love one day,
and that's why he's being clingy.

02:59.512 --> 03:00.555
He's a total jerk.

03:01.973 --> 03:04.767
It's not a crime to fall in love, is it?

03:04.851 --> 03:07.562
NOT A CRIME TO FALL IN LOVE

03:09.147 --> 03:11.608
Whatever.
Take your underwear and go to your room.

03:16.279 --> 03:17.530
All right.

03:19.240 --> 03:21.409
This one, and this one…

03:23.870 --> 03:25.371
Stop buying so much makeup!

03:25.455 --> 03:26.456
How dare you.

03:28.625 --> 03:29.834
You're in trouble now.

03:29.918 --> 03:31.836
Your secret will soon be out
on a school trip.

03:33.004 --> 03:35.173
I'm going to be the last to fall asleep.

03:35.256 --> 03:38.218
I'll shower after everyone's asleep,
then put my makeup back on.

03:38.885 --> 03:40.970
What painstaking effort
to hide your bare face.

03:42.472 --> 03:45.516
Why were you punching the doll?
Did Soo-ho dump you?

03:47.060 --> 03:49.020
What are you on about?
I didn't get dumped.

03:49.103 --> 03:50.939
I thought you liked Soo-ho.

03:51.940 --> 03:53.274
We're just friends.

03:53.942 --> 03:54.859
Okay, sure.

03:55.985 --> 03:59.322
The girls I was good friends with
always ended up asking me out.

03:59.405 --> 04:01.950
Something about developing
deeper feelings and so on.

04:03.034 --> 04:05.995
Don't lose both friendship and love, okay?

04:19.092 --> 04:20.593
I could have taken the bus here.

04:20.677 --> 04:22.387
No, your bags are heavy.

04:23.179 --> 04:24.305
Thanks, Hee…

04:24.389 --> 04:26.766
- I said, thanks.
- Sure.

04:27.308 --> 04:28.518
- I'll be off then.
- Bye.

04:29.519 --> 04:31.729
- Listen to your teacher!
- Got it!

04:37.360 --> 04:39.070
Jun-woo.

04:41.614 --> 04:42.448
Jun-woo!

04:47.453 --> 04:48.663
What are you doing?

04:48.746 --> 04:51.040
I have some debt.

04:52.166 --> 04:53.543
A debt? How much?

04:54.043 --> 04:55.503
Did you borrow from loan sharks?

04:56.838 --> 04:59.340
- I took out a student loan…
- A student loan.

05:01.175 --> 05:02.844
Wait, how old are you?

05:03.511 --> 05:04.929
I was born in 1990.

05:05.013 --> 05:06.806
- Early 1990.
- 1990.

05:15.898 --> 05:18.818
All I've been able to save until now
is this paltry sum.

05:27.702 --> 05:29.120
I'm sure you're disappointed.

05:29.746 --> 05:32.081
This is why I didn't want to date--

05:33.708 --> 05:37.628
All the blood, sweat, and tears you shed
struggling to save money are all in here.

05:37.712 --> 05:39.672
It's not paltry, no matter the amount.

05:40.465 --> 05:41.507
Hee-kyung.

05:44.052 --> 05:45.178
Let me get by you.

05:49.307 --> 05:50.224
Jun-woo,

05:53.311 --> 05:54.312
please sit here.

06:02.487 --> 06:05.198
I bought these on my business trip
because you came to mind.

06:05.907 --> 06:07.158
They fit you perfectly.

06:07.241 --> 06:09.160
I wanted you to wear these and come to me.

06:10.578 --> 06:14.082
I'll be good to you.
Come to me and be my man, Han Jun-woo.

06:18.086 --> 06:19.128
Hee-kyung!

06:21.964 --> 06:23.341
I forgot my phone.

06:24.801 --> 06:26.260
- Good morning!
- Hi.

06:27.553 --> 06:29.639
- What is it?
- I forgot my phone.

06:29.722 --> 06:31.682
Jeez. You're so clumsy.

06:31.766 --> 06:33.601
Why did you leave it?

06:33.684 --> 06:35.061
- Do it properly!
- Mom!

06:35.144 --> 06:37.021
- I'm sorry, Mom!
- I'm sorry, Mom!

06:37.105 --> 06:38.439
Open the lid. Let's go.

06:38.523 --> 06:41.150
- These are just some snacks.
- That's a likely story.

06:41.234 --> 06:43.194
Is this how they package
snacks these days?

06:43.277 --> 06:44.278
Go!

06:46.989 --> 06:47.824
Do you want some?

06:47.907 --> 06:50.284
You must be thirsty.
Would you like to down a bottle?

06:50.952 --> 06:52.537
I'm sorry.

06:53.287 --> 06:55.081
- Isn't it cold?
- What's in your chest?

06:55.164 --> 06:56.499
Open it up. Go on!

06:57.166 --> 06:59.252
You brats are being ridiculous!

06:59.335 --> 07:00.336
Go over there!

07:01.212 --> 07:02.672
Are you guys bartenders?

07:02.755 --> 07:04.841
- Why do you carry all these drinks?
- Mr. Han.

07:04.924 --> 07:07.468
- Hope you have a safe trip.
- Thank you.

07:09.846 --> 07:11.264
You look cute.

07:12.348 --> 07:13.433
They're so annoying.

07:13.516 --> 07:15.226
I should get a girlfriend too.

07:15.309 --> 07:18.563
Hey, if that were up to you,
how come you never had a girlfriend?

07:18.646 --> 07:20.857
What's with the hat?
Trying to be a vagabond?

07:20.940 --> 07:22.984
That's why you don't have a girlfriend.

07:23.067 --> 07:26.446
- Okay, make a heart.
- What the heck? They're also a thing?

07:26.529 --> 07:27.530
What's going on?

07:27.613 --> 07:29.073
You two have matching outfits.

07:29.157 --> 07:31.742
Are you going to surprise us
with news that you're dating?

07:32.910 --> 07:34.078
Not at all!

07:34.162 --> 07:36.330
Ju-kyung, this looks calculated.

07:36.414 --> 07:38.416
Do you want to be my girlfriend that much?

07:38.499 --> 07:40.877
- Then how about we start dating?
- What's wrong with you?

07:40.960 --> 07:43.129
- Put on your jacket already.
- It's hot. I don't want to.

07:43.212 --> 07:44.422
It's not hot, it's cold.

07:44.505 --> 07:45.840
- I'm healthy. I'm fine.
- They're cute.

07:45.923 --> 07:48.009
I could draw on some stripes.
It'll be quick.

07:48.092 --> 07:49.552
Hey, Soo-ho, you're here.

08:00.855 --> 08:02.607
- Sit here.
- What?

08:02.690 --> 08:04.108
Soo-ho, you sat in the front.

08:04.192 --> 08:05.151
I'll sit next to you.

08:08.279 --> 08:09.655
Double o seven, bang!

08:10.615 --> 08:12.575
Double o seven--

08:13.493 --> 08:16.245
- Bang!
- Time out.

08:17.038 --> 08:20.666
Are you sitting together
because you two are an item?

08:21.250 --> 08:23.503
- Date!
- Date!

08:23.586 --> 08:26.339
- Date!
- Date!

08:26.422 --> 08:28.341
There are plenty of seats in the front.

08:28.424 --> 08:29.592
I prefer the back seats.

08:37.517 --> 08:38.976
SAEBOM HIGH SCHOOL
SCHOOL TRIP

08:43.356 --> 08:45.942
Junior class five, look here.
One, two, three!

08:46.984 --> 08:49.654
Get settled in the tents
assigned to your groups.

08:49.737 --> 08:51.656
- Okay.
- We'll meet back here in 30 minutes.

08:51.739 --> 08:53.241
- Okay!
- Okay!

08:57.411 --> 08:58.371
Ju-kyung.

09:02.124 --> 09:03.584
- Su-ah!
- One, two, three!

09:04.418 --> 09:05.795
One, two, three.

09:06.295 --> 09:08.756
One, two, three.

09:08.839 --> 09:10.132
One, two, three.

09:10.758 --> 09:12.134
One, two, three.

09:12.218 --> 09:14.637
- All right, it came out well.
- Let's go.

09:15.179 --> 09:16.973
My bag is so heavy.

09:18.432 --> 09:22.603
Gosh, just the youngsters' coming
has changed the air around here.

09:23.187 --> 09:24.355
- Hello
- Hello.

09:24.438 --> 09:26.691
Welcome.

09:26.774 --> 09:29.569
I'm the site manager here.
Let me know if you need anything.

09:29.652 --> 09:30.945
Thank you.

09:31.028 --> 09:33.030
By the way, your pet bird is so pretty.

09:33.114 --> 09:33.948
Sorry?

09:35.366 --> 09:36.242
That bird?

09:38.035 --> 09:39.870
- What bird?
- That bird.

09:43.291 --> 09:44.125
The…

09:44.667 --> 09:45.501
That bird.

09:51.591 --> 09:52.508
What's that mic for?

09:52.592 --> 09:53.426
This?

09:53.509 --> 09:55.386
I brought this to stay up all night long!

09:55.469 --> 09:58.472
Dating is a must
Marriage is an option

09:58.556 --> 10:00.057
Amor Fati

10:00.558 --> 10:03.102
- She's in the mood to party.
- Guys, tonight…

10:03.686 --> 10:06.188
- nobody is sleeping!
- Nobody is sleeping

10:06.272 --> 10:09.275
- Dating is a must!
- Must!

10:09.817 --> 10:11.736
This is my first time sleeping in a tent.

10:11.819 --> 10:13.154
It's been a while for me too.

10:13.237 --> 10:16.032
My last time was with Soo-ho's family
when I was younger.

10:17.074 --> 10:20.036
I see you've been really close with him
since you were young.

10:21.454 --> 10:22.288
That reminds me.

10:23.706 --> 10:27.627
A girl from class six asked Soo-ho out,
but he rejected her for someone else.

10:27.710 --> 10:30.588
Are you serious?
Lee Soo-ho has someone else?

10:30.671 --> 10:31.505
What?

10:31.589 --> 10:34.884
Isn't that person you, Kangsu?

10:34.967 --> 10:37.803
You bought that?
It probably was just an excuse.

10:37.887 --> 10:40.348
- You're always trying to set people up.
- Come on.

10:40.431 --> 10:43.225
There were a ton of rumors about you two
since freshman year.

10:43.309 --> 10:45.061
You two look perfect for each other.

10:45.144 --> 10:47.521
How can you two just stay friends
for ten long years?

10:48.272 --> 10:49.523
Tell us, Kangsu.

10:49.607 --> 10:53.069
You've never thought of him
as more than a friend even for a second?

10:56.864 --> 10:59.158
- What are you talking about?
- You never have?

10:59.241 --> 11:01.118
Really?

11:01.202 --> 11:02.620
Gosh, it tickles!

11:06.248 --> 11:07.708
Hey guys, look over here!

11:07.792 --> 11:09.752
Make ugly faces except me.
We'll take turns.

11:09.835 --> 11:12.296
- All right.
- One, two, three.

11:13.172 --> 11:14.423
One, two…

11:14.507 --> 11:15.883
Are you kidding? Don't try me.

11:15.966 --> 11:17.218
- Seriously.
- Hey, come on.

11:17.885 --> 11:18.969
If you do that again…

11:19.053 --> 11:21.347
- Do it right.
- Make faces properly!

11:21.430 --> 11:24.350
Guys, let's change the background.

11:25.893 --> 11:28.396
- One, two, three!
- Hey, kids!

11:28.479 --> 11:30.189
Gather here. I'll take your pictures.

11:30.272 --> 11:31.941
- Okay!
- Okay!

11:32.775 --> 11:34.318
Please make my legs look longer.

11:35.361 --> 11:37.405
Soo-ho, get in there.

11:37.488 --> 11:39.156
- I'm good.
- Okay, then.

11:41.367 --> 11:43.160
You have no social skills whatsoever.

11:43.911 --> 11:45.037
Why don't you join them?

11:45.621 --> 11:47.123
I'm good. It's a hassle.

11:47.206 --> 11:49.250
- Here we go.
- Okay!

11:49.333 --> 11:52.086
One, two, three, four.

11:52.795 --> 11:55.339
- What was that?
- Come on. What's with the "four"?

11:55.423 --> 11:57.007
- I closed my eyes!
- It'll look more natural.

11:57.091 --> 11:58.717
- What the heck?
- Sir!

11:58.801 --> 12:00.428
Take a picture of this couple here.

12:05.433 --> 12:07.852
Hey! Who's dating in school?

12:07.935 --> 12:10.354
- It's not like that.
- If I catch you doing anything…

12:10.438 --> 12:12.440
- They're dating.
- You're caught in the picture, sir.

12:14.859 --> 12:16.402
- Let's make hearts!
- Here we go.

12:16.485 --> 12:19.280
- Okay!
- One, two! I took it.

12:20.781 --> 12:22.074
- Take a good one!
- Come on!

12:22.158 --> 12:24.160
What's going on? Are you really a couple?

12:24.243 --> 12:26.620
You two are dating, right?
These guys are going out!

12:27.746 --> 12:28.706
It's not like that.

12:28.789 --> 12:30.416
Hey, take your T-shirt off.

12:30.499 --> 12:33.085
Why are you trying to take my clothes off?
Someone's naughty.

12:33.169 --> 12:35.379
I meant, change your clothes!

12:40.134 --> 12:43.637
A witty star in recreation sessions,
Mr. Wit will be your host today. Welcome!

12:44.722 --> 12:46.307
The newspaper game. You know it, right?

12:46.390 --> 12:48.392
- Yes!
- Four people make a team.

12:48.476 --> 12:51.896
The important thing is to choose someone
who's good or that you really like.

12:51.979 --> 12:53.230
Make groups of four!

12:53.314 --> 12:54.815
That's right. Form groups.

12:55.399 --> 12:57.109
Someone you are interested in…

12:57.193 --> 12:59.361
Ju-kyung! Come here!

12:59.445 --> 13:01.530
If you don't like someone,
kick them out of your group.

13:01.614 --> 13:03.407
That's it. It must be a group of four.

13:03.491 --> 13:05.117
Three? No. Five? No way.

13:05.201 --> 13:08.746
- Go on.
- If you got five, kick someone out.

13:09.497 --> 13:12.082
- Show your determination.
- You're leaving your girlfriend?

13:12.166 --> 13:13.334
Four people per group.

13:13.417 --> 13:15.294
Is there a loner? All right.

13:15.377 --> 13:16.795
- Come here.
- Everyone in groups of four?

13:16.879 --> 13:18.047
- Yes!
- Yes!

13:18.130 --> 13:19.423
Everyone is in groups.

13:19.507 --> 13:20.633
- What's that?
- What's he doing?

13:20.716 --> 13:23.135
All right, then.

13:25.679 --> 13:26.680
What did I say?

13:26.764 --> 13:29.183
All right, let me explain
the rules of the game.

13:29.266 --> 13:32.353
You will fold the newspaper,
and everyone has to stand on it.

13:32.436 --> 13:34.480
You succeed if you can hold
for five seconds.

13:34.563 --> 13:37.149
Everyone get on it.
Go stand on the newspaper.

13:37.233 --> 13:39.109
First place is ours. Hold on tight.

13:40.236 --> 13:41.904
- Let's go!
- Let's go!

13:42.863 --> 13:44.490
Are your feet on the newspaper?

13:44.573 --> 13:47.076
Your feet cannot be outside the newspaper.

13:47.660 --> 13:49.370
- Hey!
- Do it right!

13:49.453 --> 13:51.247
Hey, Su-ah, this isn't right.

13:51.330 --> 13:52.706
Go, team!

13:52.790 --> 13:54.959
Let's begin the countdown. One.

13:55.626 --> 13:56.460
Two.

13:57.169 --> 13:59.380
- Hey, hold on!
- Three.

14:04.885 --> 14:07.221
Give a round of applause
to the last three teams!

14:07.972 --> 14:10.349
You're good. So passionate. I love it.

14:10.432 --> 14:11.267
What's important…

14:11.350 --> 14:12.560
Okay, focus.

14:12.643 --> 14:15.437
Since these teams are way too good,
let's upgrade it.

14:15.521 --> 14:16.689
It will be harder.

14:16.772 --> 14:20.609
Fold the newspaper into its quarter size.

14:20.693 --> 14:22.653
Three teams. Don't complain and fold it.

14:22.736 --> 14:25.781
Let's try our best now. Fold the papers.

14:25.865 --> 14:28.450
- What are you doing, Hyun-kyu?
- Look at that!

14:31.412 --> 14:32.496
Where are you going?

14:39.211 --> 14:40.963
I don't want to lose to them. Get on.

14:42.131 --> 14:43.591
One, two, three!

14:45.634 --> 14:46.927
That's not right.

14:50.931 --> 14:52.099
That student is awesome.

14:52.182 --> 14:53.809
He's carrying her.

15:02.568 --> 15:04.069
I'm going to start the countdown.

15:04.153 --> 15:08.908
Five, four, three, two, one!

15:08.991 --> 15:10.743
The team of boys is out!

15:10.826 --> 15:12.494
Two teams made it.

15:12.578 --> 15:14.788
They both are doing well,
but we need a winner.

15:15.372 --> 15:17.625
The first team to fall will lose the game.

15:17.708 --> 15:20.002
Are you ready? Guys, lift one leg up.

15:20.085 --> 15:22.046
Can we just keep it down? I can't do it.

15:22.129 --> 15:23.964
Lift one leg, please. Let's go!

15:24.048 --> 15:25.716
I'll count down as soon as you lift.

15:25.799 --> 15:28.427
Lift your legs. Five, four, three…

15:28.510 --> 15:29.887
Your hair smells like poop, Hyun-kyu!

15:29.970 --> 15:33.182
…two, one! Out!

15:33.265 --> 15:35.351
Gosh, that was very odd!

15:36.143 --> 15:37.478
Wash your hair!

15:38.812 --> 15:39.813
We won!

15:39.897 --> 15:42.399
Take your prize!
Congratulations! Good job.

15:42.483 --> 15:44.568
- You did great.
- It hurts here.

15:44.652 --> 15:46.820
- Where do you mean?
- Right here!

15:49.865 --> 15:53.452
You've never thought of him
as more than a friend even for a second?

15:57.122 --> 15:58.666
It's a sign for a restricted area.

15:58.749 --> 16:01.043
- Hey, isn't it a little creepy here?
- He's talking.

16:01.126 --> 16:02.795
You're a chicken for such a big guy.

16:02.878 --> 16:05.172
- Not there!
- My goodness.

16:08.550 --> 16:10.177
You can never go this way.

16:10.260 --> 16:12.930
- Why? Is there something in the forest?
- Why is that?

16:14.014 --> 16:15.933
I can't lose any more men.

16:17.142 --> 16:18.435
- Excuse me?
- What men?

16:19.436 --> 16:20.396
Over there…

16:22.106 --> 16:23.482
Never mind.

16:24.441 --> 16:25.859
Pretend I never mentioned it.

16:25.943 --> 16:29.530
Anyway, don't ever go that way. Okay?

16:29.613 --> 16:31.407
- Got it?
- Okay.

16:31.490 --> 16:34.535
- Yes?
- Yes!

16:38.205 --> 16:39.206
What is this place?

16:40.249 --> 16:41.333
- Hey…
- I'm so curious.

16:41.417 --> 16:42.376
Let's not go there.

16:42.459 --> 16:45.170
- No, I'm curious.
- Let's leave.

16:47.673 --> 16:48.882
Nobody's buying them.

16:48.966 --> 16:51.051
Stop pressuring customers and go home!

16:52.219 --> 16:53.554
What about the leftover ones?

16:53.637 --> 16:55.514
I could arrange your funeral to use them!

16:56.098 --> 16:58.225
Do whatever, or throw them away!

17:09.445 --> 17:14.033
PRINCE COMICS

17:21.457 --> 17:24.001
HIRING A WEEKEND PART-TIMER
PAY AND HOURS NEGOTIABLE

17:32.760 --> 17:34.553
No scented candle has been this good.

17:34.636 --> 17:36.388
Is it perfume or a scented candle?

17:36.472 --> 17:39.016
- I'm not buying.
- I'm just giving it to you.

17:39.099 --> 17:41.435
Please leave if you're here
to talk about the treasure ship.

17:41.518 --> 17:43.520
The proudest moment in my life

17:43.604 --> 17:46.982
is not falling for it when you asked me
to invest in the treasure ship.

17:47.066 --> 17:50.194
Hey, let's not dwell on the past.

17:50.944 --> 17:53.530
Well, actually…

17:54.323 --> 17:55.866
Here, well…

17:56.784 --> 17:58.243
The weekend part-time position…

17:58.327 --> 17:59.870
Can I please take it?

17:59.953 --> 18:00.788
The part-time job?

18:01.622 --> 18:02.456
I found someone.

18:03.040 --> 18:03.874
Already?

18:04.374 --> 18:05.542
All right, then.

18:08.921 --> 18:09.755
Is that good?

18:11.131 --> 18:13.258
Then give me just one bite.

18:16.095 --> 18:17.471
Gosh, what are you doing now?

18:17.554 --> 18:19.848
- Just a bite!
- Seriously.

18:22.935 --> 18:25.020
- Hey, do you want this?
- Put more on.

18:26.021 --> 18:27.064
It's good.

18:28.440 --> 18:29.608
Hey, Kim Si-hyun.

18:31.110 --> 18:32.236
- What is it?
- What is it?

18:33.195 --> 18:34.780
I'm sorry about the smell earlier.

18:35.364 --> 18:36.698
I washed my hair after.

18:37.282 --> 18:38.117
Enjoy.

18:38.200 --> 18:39.368
He has a conscience.

18:39.451 --> 18:40.702
Hey, Hyun-kyu.

18:41.703 --> 18:43.288
It wasn't that bad.

18:43.372 --> 18:45.791
- Don't lie!
- You said it smelled awful!

18:45.874 --> 18:48.210
- Right?
- What's going on with her?

18:50.045 --> 18:51.088
What's this smell?

18:51.964 --> 18:52.798
Put it here.

18:52.881 --> 18:54.341
- Have some mushrooms.
- Thank you!

18:54.424 --> 18:56.969
- Let me know if you need anything else.
- Okay. Thank you!

18:57.052 --> 18:58.679
- Enjoy your meal!
- Enjoy your meal!

19:00.848 --> 19:02.266
It's drenched in his body odor.

19:05.102 --> 19:05.936
Come on.

19:06.478 --> 19:08.772
It's not as if she's
some precious museum artifact.

19:08.856 --> 19:10.774
Is she a gothic celadon or something?

19:10.858 --> 19:11.817
It's Goryeo celadon.

19:12.776 --> 19:15.821
What I'm saying is,
when are you going to make a move?

19:15.904 --> 19:18.157
I'll set the tone,
so tease out how she feels.

19:18.240 --> 19:20.325
- And ask her right---
- Try this.

19:25.497 --> 19:27.875
- Make a wrap with a perilla leaf.
- Try this one.

19:29.710 --> 19:31.670
- Super tasty!
- It's good!

19:31.753 --> 19:33.297
Are you an animal?

19:33.380 --> 19:35.132
Let it cook before you eat it!

19:35.215 --> 19:37.384
Don't eat like a pig
just because you're eating pork.

19:37.467 --> 19:40.012
- Eat like a person.
- Sir, I am a person.

19:40.095 --> 19:41.471
Are you enjoying your dinner?

19:41.555 --> 19:42.848
- Yes!
- Yes!

19:42.931 --> 19:44.808
Okay, let me check your fire.

19:44.892 --> 19:46.351
It looks good, yes.

19:46.435 --> 19:47.436
By the way, sir.

19:48.020 --> 19:49.938
What were you going to tell us earlier?

19:50.689 --> 19:51.732
That?

19:51.815 --> 19:53.025
That's just some old tale.

19:53.108 --> 19:54.818
What is it about? Tell us, please!

19:54.902 --> 19:57.362
It's nothing special.
Don't get hung up on it.

19:57.446 --> 19:59.865
- Tell us!
- Please!

20:00.532 --> 20:02.534
All right then. I guess I'll tell you.

20:07.831 --> 20:08.665
Listen up.

20:08.749 --> 20:09.666
- All right.
- Yes.

20:10.292 --> 20:11.543
A long time ago,

20:12.211 --> 20:15.631
there was a well in the forest over there.

20:21.595 --> 20:22.429
My wife,

20:23.055 --> 20:24.348
we're now man and wife.

20:24.431 --> 20:26.058
Why do you still cover your face?

20:26.725 --> 20:28.352
It's because I am embarrassed.

20:28.435 --> 20:29.895
What to do with such a shy wife?

20:32.439 --> 20:35.776
The rooster will cry
before we consummate our marriage.

20:36.485 --> 20:38.862
Please answer this one question then.

20:40.906 --> 20:44.409
My husband, would you like an apricot
that looks delicious but is fake?

20:44.493 --> 20:46.662
However good it looks,
one cannot eat a fake apricot.

20:46.745 --> 20:49.414
It is said that one should not judge
a book by its cover.

20:50.707 --> 20:51.750
But why do you ask?

20:53.752 --> 20:55.128
Enough about fake apricots.

20:56.004 --> 20:56.838
Come here.

20:57.506 --> 20:58.340
Don't be shy,

20:59.174 --> 21:00.175
and show me your face.

21:01.176 --> 21:02.010
Then…

21:02.761 --> 21:04.471
don't be alarmed.

21:13.689 --> 21:15.691
- Husband!
- Is this why you hid your face?

21:15.774 --> 21:18.694
You said you wouldn't judge
a book by its cover.

21:20.153 --> 21:21.989
- Husband!
- Let go of me!

21:22.072 --> 21:23.991
- Where are you going?
- Let go!

21:24.074 --> 21:26.243
Sun-dol!

21:26.326 --> 21:28.328
- Husband!
- Let go! Sun-dol!

21:36.837 --> 21:38.171
Being born ugly,

21:38.255 --> 21:41.591
I never got to experience the joy
of being loved by my dear husband.

21:44.845 --> 21:45.679
My life

21:46.179 --> 21:49.725
is worse than that of a fake apricot.

21:57.399 --> 22:02.529
What do you like about me so much
that you follow me everywhere?

22:02.612 --> 22:05.824
I like your broad chest, sir!

22:05.907 --> 22:10.037
What are you talking about?
I like your rock-hard calves, sir.

22:10.120 --> 22:11.955
They are fine indeed.
I like everything about you.

22:12.039 --> 22:14.333
Goodness, that's lovely to hear!

22:14.416 --> 22:18.128
Then, let's have fun tonight
until the sun comes up!

22:18.211 --> 22:20.339
- Sounds great!
- Sounds great, sir!

22:27.721 --> 22:29.681
The woman who died in resentment

22:29.765 --> 22:32.476
became the Ugly Ghost
and wanders around at night.

22:32.559 --> 22:34.102
When she comes across someone,

22:35.520 --> 22:36.813
she steals their face away.

22:37.397 --> 22:40.317
So people in this area
never go near there at night.

22:41.443 --> 22:43.028
Some people went missing,

22:43.111 --> 22:46.615
so we had a shaman perform a service
to soothe the Ugly Ghost by the well.

22:50.160 --> 22:52.913
There's no such thing as a ghost
that steals people's faces.

22:52.996 --> 22:54.581
I can't even pretend to be scared.

22:54.664 --> 22:56.917
Is that why you warned us
not to go to the forest?

22:57.501 --> 23:00.962
But she only steals the faces
of good-looking people.

23:01.046 --> 23:04.883
So use your good judgment
and don't wander around alone.

23:04.966 --> 23:06.343
Got it? Yes?

23:07.886 --> 23:09.221
It'll be night soon.

23:10.889 --> 23:12.015
Don't you worry.

23:12.099 --> 23:13.934
You all should be perfectly fine.

23:15.811 --> 23:17.395
- But sir!
- Come on.

23:17.479 --> 23:21.233
- Except me, you all are…
- Stay together and hold hands, okay?

23:21.316 --> 23:23.276
THE LATE JEONG SE-YEON
TRIBUTE ALBUM PROJECT

23:23.360 --> 23:24.945
SE-YEON AND LEO'S LONGING LOVE

23:35.413 --> 23:36.373
Nice to meet you.

23:37.040 --> 23:39.668
I'm Lim Hee-kyung
from Move Entertainment's Planning Team.

23:40.836 --> 23:42.754
By the way, have we met somewhere…

23:42.838 --> 23:44.047
I don't think so.

23:44.131 --> 23:45.006
Right?

23:46.007 --> 23:47.050
I must be mistaken.

23:47.634 --> 23:48.677
What do you want?

23:50.428 --> 23:51.847
I'll get straight to the point.

23:52.430 --> 23:54.266
On the first anniversary
of Jeong Se-yeon's passing,

23:54.349 --> 23:57.352
the company plans to release
a tribute album with his unreleased songs.

23:57.978 --> 24:01.022
But most of the songs Mr. Jeong left

24:01.940 --> 24:05.402
are collaborative works
with someone called Leo.

24:06.611 --> 24:10.240
Do you know how hard we tried to find you?
You are Leo, aren't you, Mr. Han?

24:12.284 --> 24:13.285
No, I'm not.

24:15.078 --> 24:16.538
Do you want to keep it a secret?

24:17.789 --> 24:19.499
Whether you believe me is up to you.

24:21.042 --> 24:22.043
But this is a joke.

24:23.003 --> 24:24.379
As soon as the bullying rumors surfaced,

24:24.462 --> 24:27.090
you kicked him out
and made him take his own life.

24:27.174 --> 24:28.717
And now you want to do this?

24:31.720 --> 24:35.015
Move Entertainment won't be releasing
a tribute album for him.

24:36.391 --> 24:37.392
I will make sure…

24:38.476 --> 24:40.604
that no such thing happens,
no matter what.

24:52.532 --> 24:54.951
How do I convince him otherwise?

25:03.543 --> 25:04.461
Hey.

25:04.544 --> 25:07.297
Hey, I'm home alone.
When are you coming home?

25:08.673 --> 25:10.675
Let the game begin.

25:10.759 --> 25:14.221
You have 30 minutes.
Order some fried chicken.

25:14.304 --> 25:16.723
Whether to eat it or not is up to you.

25:16.806 --> 25:19.976
Come on. Cut it out.

25:24.439 --> 25:27.025
- Good evening, Mr. Lee.
- I appreciate your hard work at this hour.

25:27.108 --> 25:28.985
Not at all. Did you have dinner yet?

25:29.069 --> 25:30.362
No, not yet.

25:30.445 --> 25:32.489
Mr. Oh, how do you feel
about fried chicken?

25:33.240 --> 25:34.824
The choice is up to you.

25:34.908 --> 25:36.243
It sounds good to me.

25:36.326 --> 25:37.702
You looked so sheepish.

25:37.786 --> 25:40.205
- Did our playing along amuse you?
- Thank you, sir.

25:40.288 --> 25:43.625
By the way, I met Mr. Han Seo-jun.

25:44.292 --> 25:45.210
Is that right?

25:45.293 --> 25:48.171
But he denied being Leo
and rejected my proposal on the spot.

25:48.255 --> 25:51.383
He was a friend of Se-yeon,
so he'd have animosity toward us.

25:51.466 --> 25:54.302
The thing is,
it's a shame to let this project go.

25:54.386 --> 25:57.472
His talent for writing songs
is too good not to be put to use.

25:57.555 --> 26:00.517
- I'll try again to persuade him.
- I admire your passion.

26:01.518 --> 26:04.562
Please keep up that mindset
and take good care of our rookies.

26:04.646 --> 26:05.647
Of course.

26:06.147 --> 26:08.316
- Take care.
- Yes. Thank you, sir.

26:10.568 --> 26:11.528
Fried chicken!

26:12.779 --> 26:15.532
About the tribute album,
were we still working on it?

26:16.449 --> 26:18.285
I thought my not green-lighting it
would kill it.

26:18.368 --> 26:20.245
I guess she was working on it by herself.

26:20.328 --> 26:21.955
I'll take care of it.

26:22.580 --> 26:23.415
Okay.

26:26.501 --> 26:27.377
Hello? Hee-kyung?

26:28.336 --> 26:30.422
No, the other teachers are sleeping.

26:31.423 --> 26:32.716
How come you're not asleep?

26:34.134 --> 26:35.552
Were you thinking about me?

26:35.635 --> 26:38.096
I actually have trouble sleeping
in unfamiliar places.

26:39.306 --> 26:40.724
Shall I sing you a lullaby?

26:40.807 --> 26:42.350
No, I'm good. I'll go to bed now.

26:43.268 --> 26:44.894
- Sleep tight.
- I love you

26:44.978 --> 26:49.816
I love you, I love you

26:50.525 --> 26:53.361
I love you, I love you

26:53.445 --> 26:55.030
- "I love you"?
- "I love you"?

26:55.113 --> 26:56.031
"I love you"?

26:56.114 --> 26:58.908
Mother, are you at karaoke?

26:58.992 --> 27:00.618
You're dating someone, aren't you?

27:01.244 --> 27:02.078
No!

27:03.580 --> 27:04.581
I'm sorry.

27:04.664 --> 27:07.042
- Good night.
- Good night.

27:07.125 --> 27:12.422
I love you!

27:12.505 --> 27:14.674
Gosh, I've lost my appetite.

27:14.758 --> 27:21.473
I love you, I love you, I love you

27:21.556 --> 27:23.475
- Everybody, scream!
- Come on, stop!

27:24.351 --> 27:27.145
- Hyun-kyu, you've shat your pants before.
- Are you joking? No.

27:27.812 --> 27:29.981
- Okay!
- Hold him down!

27:30.065 --> 27:31.274
- Hey, Si-hyun,
- So smelly.

27:31.858 --> 27:33.818
you think you're the prettiest
in the whole universe.

27:33.902 --> 27:34.903
I do not!

27:37.864 --> 27:39.824
Soo-ho, you've had your first kiss.

27:41.368 --> 27:43.787
Three, two, one.

27:43.870 --> 27:46.164
- You didn't answer!
- You need to answer fast.

27:46.247 --> 27:48.166
- Answer the question.
- He's never played before.

27:50.085 --> 27:51.461
Love or friendship?

27:53.505 --> 27:54.631
Love.

27:57.092 --> 27:58.259
You're so smarmy.

27:58.343 --> 28:00.136
- Let's hit him for that!
- Get him!

28:00.220 --> 28:02.138
- Hey, it's the truth.
- That was too much.

28:03.306 --> 28:04.933
- You think I'm handsome.
- Yes.

28:06.267 --> 28:08.770
- Lies!
- Hit her a lot!

28:08.853 --> 28:12.023
- Yoo Tae-hoon or ATEEN?
- Obviously my babe, Tae-hoon!

28:12.732 --> 28:13.775
- Truth!
- Su-ah!

28:13.858 --> 28:16.361
- Let's hit both of them.
- I can't stand the sight.

28:16.444 --> 28:17.320
Beat them!

28:17.404 --> 28:19.531
There's someone you like.

28:20.281 --> 28:21.658
There is!

28:23.743 --> 28:25.870
- Lies.
- Are you serious?

28:25.954 --> 28:28.873
- Liar!
- It's so childish!

28:31.126 --> 28:33.795
You've thought about
breaking up with Su-ah.

28:35.630 --> 28:36.548
Never.

28:41.636 --> 28:43.054
Next!

28:43.138 --> 28:44.556
- Again.
- What?

28:44.639 --> 28:47.726
- You've considered breaking up with me.
- No. I said, no!

28:50.270 --> 28:51.563
See? I said, no.

28:51.646 --> 28:53.690
Again!
You've considered breaking up with me.

28:53.773 --> 28:54.607
Never!

28:56.109 --> 28:57.110
No?

28:57.193 --> 28:58.903
I don't think so. I think you did.

28:58.987 --> 28:59.863
No.

28:59.946 --> 29:02.657
- I see. You've had such thoughts then.
- No--

29:03.658 --> 29:05.493
We're done!

29:05.577 --> 29:06.911
- Su-ah!
- Su-ah!

29:06.995 --> 29:09.372
- Su-ah!
- Su-ah!

29:09.456 --> 29:10.540
Su-ah!

29:11.916 --> 29:13.501
I'm a girl.

29:19.674 --> 29:21.092
It works fine.

29:23.470 --> 29:26.890
There's someone I like.

29:30.935 --> 29:31.770
What?

29:32.520 --> 29:33.897
It worked this time around.

29:37.317 --> 29:38.318
Soo-ho.

29:39.360 --> 29:40.487
When did you get here?

29:42.071 --> 29:43.364
You could have let me know.

29:46.034 --> 29:47.035
Excuse me.

29:48.536 --> 29:49.370
Ju-kyung.

29:50.622 --> 29:51.623
What?

29:51.706 --> 29:52.540
What is it?

29:52.624 --> 29:53.458
I want you…

29:54.542 --> 29:55.376
to come with me.

29:55.960 --> 29:56.795
What?

29:59.130 --> 30:01.216
Sure. Okay.

30:05.053 --> 30:06.429
Is he upset about something?

30:07.806 --> 30:09.015
What could it be?

30:17.148 --> 30:18.566
Why were you avoiding me today?

30:19.275 --> 30:21.194
No, I wasn't avoiding you.

30:23.363 --> 30:25.406
- Really?
- Yes, of course not.

30:27.450 --> 30:28.827
Want to try the lie detector?

30:29.327 --> 30:31.120
Well, I don't think it's reliable.

30:32.872 --> 30:33.957
Never mind, then.

30:35.542 --> 30:38.586
Gosh, the forest path
looks even prettier at night.

30:42.924 --> 30:44.092
There aren't any benches?

30:45.677 --> 30:47.470
Goodness, there are so many stars!

30:49.222 --> 30:50.390
Where?

30:50.473 --> 30:52.183
I guess it's pretty cloudy.

31:02.235 --> 31:03.403
Well…

31:03.486 --> 31:06.906
You know how zombies jump out
from the bushes in movies, so…

31:06.990 --> 31:08.199
Right.

31:11.244 --> 31:13.746
So what were you going to say? Why are we…

31:15.290 --> 31:16.124
Well…

31:18.126 --> 31:19.335
- That is…
- What?

31:19.961 --> 31:20.879
Look at that!

31:33.850 --> 31:34.893
It's so pretty.

31:35.977 --> 31:37.186
It's just like a picture.

31:39.439 --> 31:40.356
Indeed.

31:47.280 --> 31:50.241
Should I put some music on?

32:01.044 --> 32:02.378
My battery's out.

32:02.462 --> 32:03.755
I'll do it.

32:17.018 --> 32:21.230
"STARLIGHT"

32:34.827 --> 32:35.662
Gosh,

32:36.287 --> 32:37.538
he's got a great voice.

32:38.373 --> 32:39.290
Who is this?

32:40.750 --> 32:41.626
Se-yeon.

32:46.005 --> 32:47.215
It's lovely.

32:49.008 --> 32:51.010
I don't think I've heard this song before.

32:53.805 --> 32:54.973
It’s an unreleased song.

32:57.308 --> 32:58.601
You're the first to hear it.

33:02.105 --> 33:03.106
Really?

33:12.573 --> 33:14.826
- I don't want to go!
- Let's go!

33:14.909 --> 33:15.827
Where are you going?

33:15.910 --> 33:17.954
He's going to go to catch the ghost.

33:18.037 --> 33:20.039
The man said
the ghost hangs out by the well.

33:20.123 --> 33:22.125
If we film the paranormal activity
and upload it on NerTube,

33:22.208 --> 33:23.793
- we'll get a ton of views, won't we?
- No.

33:23.876 --> 33:25.044
You should come with us.

33:26.337 --> 33:27.255
I can't be bothered.

33:27.797 --> 33:28.631
You guys go ahead.

33:30.341 --> 33:31.217
Seo-jun,

33:31.300 --> 33:33.136
are you scared of ghosts?

33:35.888 --> 33:37.098
Where is the well?

33:40.643 --> 33:43.021
- Han Seo-jun.
- Push him.

33:52.572 --> 33:54.657
Sorry. I forgot you didn't like photos.

33:58.995 --> 34:00.621
Why don't you like it though?

34:03.082 --> 34:04.083
When I was young,

34:05.043 --> 34:06.669
I had a hard time
because of the paparazzi.

34:08.796 --> 34:10.214
No wonder you don't like it.

34:10.715 --> 34:12.133
It must have been tiring.

34:14.886 --> 34:15.928
Why didn't you take it?

34:16.971 --> 34:17.805
What?

34:29.734 --> 34:31.027
Do you like taking pictures?

34:33.654 --> 34:35.865
I didn't before,

34:37.158 --> 34:38.868
but after I started wearing makeup,

34:41.037 --> 34:41.871
I grew to like it.

34:42.622 --> 34:45.083
- You like it?
- Yes, I like it.

34:45.750 --> 34:47.085
Do you like riding a boat?

34:48.461 --> 34:50.505
Yes, I like it.

34:53.841 --> 34:54.801
Then…

34:55.843 --> 34:57.261
do you like listening to music?

34:57.345 --> 34:59.138
Of course, I like it.

35:08.731 --> 35:10.733
Do you want to take a picture with me?

35:45.309 --> 35:46.144
Ju-kyung!

35:49.105 --> 35:50.857
Hey guys, it's not too late…

35:52.775 --> 35:55.194
- Hey, let go of me.
- These chickens.

35:55.278 --> 35:57.029
Guys, there's literally nothing here.

35:57.113 --> 35:59.740
- Hey, I think something's there.
- There's no such thing.

35:59.824 --> 36:01.159
Let's walk faster. Come on.

36:01.242 --> 36:03.411
Hey, Seo-jun, hurry up!

36:03.494 --> 36:05.621
What are they going on about?

36:05.705 --> 36:08.749
I'm really sorry. It's all because of me.

36:10.710 --> 36:13.504
By the way, is my makeup all washed away?

36:15.673 --> 36:16.507
Yes.

36:19.218 --> 36:20.595
What do I do?

36:20.678 --> 36:22.388
They can't see my face.

36:23.681 --> 36:25.349
Do you want me to bring your makeup?

36:26.434 --> 36:28.644
I have my underwear
and everything in my bag.

36:30.062 --> 36:32.899
It's okay, I'll just cover my face and go.

36:36.944 --> 36:39.071
- You must be freezing.
- It's all right.

36:39.906 --> 36:40.907
I'm not cold at all.

36:47.246 --> 36:49.040
You have to keep your body temperature.

36:50.958 --> 36:52.335
Stop it, heart.

36:53.211 --> 36:56.464
This isn't about romance.
It's about survival right now.

37:04.722 --> 37:05.556
Su-jin.

37:13.189 --> 37:14.357
Soo-ho?

37:18.152 --> 37:19.779
What happened? Why are you soaking wet?

37:19.862 --> 37:22.073
- Did you fall into the water?
- I stumbled on the path.

37:22.156 --> 37:24.742
You should have been careful.
Are you okay?

37:24.825 --> 37:25.701
Yes.

37:25.785 --> 37:28.871
I heard you left with Ju-kyung…

37:28.955 --> 37:30.957
- No, I didn't.
- Really?

37:34.669 --> 37:35.628
What's that sound?

37:38.422 --> 37:40.258
- Probably a wild boar.
- What?

37:41.175 --> 37:42.843
- Let's go.
- Hey.

37:54.730 --> 37:55.606
You go ahead.

37:56.190 --> 37:58.109
- What about you?
- I need to find something.

37:58.901 --> 38:00.111
Wait, Soo-ho.

38:22.216 --> 38:24.760
Everyone, the well is right there.

38:24.844 --> 38:26.637
It is eerie, isn't it?

38:32.310 --> 38:33.352
Stop it, dude.

38:33.436 --> 38:35.855
Don't do that. It's not funny.

38:38.149 --> 38:38.983
What's that?

38:39.650 --> 38:41.944
- Stop messing around.
- I knew there was something.

38:42.028 --> 38:42.862
Guys.

38:43.821 --> 38:44.739
It's nothing.

38:45.281 --> 38:48.617
Everyone, I heard a strange noise
coming from over there.

38:48.701 --> 38:50.328
I'm going to take a look.

38:50.411 --> 38:51.245
No…

39:07.345 --> 39:09.972
They didn't recognize me, did they?
What do I do now?

39:11.307 --> 39:12.641
Hey, Cho-rong!

39:13.934 --> 39:14.769
Damn it.

39:16.604 --> 39:18.731
Cho-rong. The well is here.

39:20.107 --> 39:21.484
Where did they all go?

39:28.157 --> 39:29.450
Where are they?

39:32.828 --> 39:34.705
Come on, leave already.

39:47.927 --> 39:48.928
Darn it.

40:00.022 --> 40:01.065
That was close.

40:09.698 --> 40:11.659
LEE SOO-HO: WHERE ARE YOU?
MISSED CALL, LEE SOO-HO

40:13.661 --> 40:15.579
Why aren't you picking up? Where are you?

40:30.177 --> 40:32.304
Hey, I just got in.

40:50.906 --> 40:52.241
It's all wet.

41:08.757 --> 41:11.886
For a moment,
it was like being in a fairy tale.

41:15.055 --> 41:17.183
But my reality is a horror story.

41:42.166 --> 41:44.585
Limju, are you up already?

41:44.668 --> 41:46.754
Yes. Of course, I'm up.

41:48.130 --> 41:50.508
This girl even looks pretty
in the morning.

42:06.106 --> 42:09.610
Why am I being transferred
to the PR team all of a sudden?

42:09.693 --> 42:11.403
It's not even that time of the year.

42:11.487 --> 42:12.655
Tell me about it.

42:12.738 --> 42:14.365
I just found out from the notice.

42:15.324 --> 42:17.701
Then what about the projects
I've been working on?

42:18.410 --> 42:19.370
Ms. Lim,

42:20.246 --> 42:23.165
did you get on the wrong side
of the CEO or the upper management?

42:23.249 --> 42:27.044
It's so weird that only you're being
transferred out of the blue.

42:27.127 --> 42:29.046
I didn't do anything wrong.

42:29.129 --> 42:30.506
And even if I did,

42:30.589 --> 42:32.967
can they just
throw their weight around like this?

42:33.676 --> 42:34.802
Hey, kids.

42:34.885 --> 42:36.679
What's the highlight of a school trip?

42:36.762 --> 42:38.514
- No honorifics!
- The food!

42:38.597 --> 42:41.809
- Talent show!
- Bibimbap!

42:41.892 --> 42:43.477
The highlight of a school trip

42:43.561 --> 42:44.853
is a treasure hunt.

42:44.937 --> 42:47.189
- That's no fun.
- That's boring.

42:47.273 --> 42:49.650
I hid things around every nook and corner,

42:49.733 --> 42:52.111
so look around and find them.

42:52.194 --> 42:54.238
We're not in elementary school anymore!

42:54.321 --> 42:56.365
We're 18, not 8.

42:56.448 --> 42:57.658
- She's right.
- Totally.

42:57.741 --> 43:00.244
- Sir, I'm hungry!
- We might faint from hunger.

43:00.327 --> 43:01.161
All right.

43:01.245 --> 43:03.539
The grand prize
is a 50,000 won gift voucher.

43:03.622 --> 43:04.999
- Did he say 50,000 won?
- 50,000 won?

43:05.082 --> 43:06.292
- We have to find it.
- 50,000 won.

43:06.375 --> 43:08.419
Let's go!

43:13.048 --> 43:15.175
Sir, I don't feel so well.

43:15.801 --> 43:18.345
- Hey, let's hurry!
- 50,000 won!

43:18.429 --> 43:21.015
- I want to find it!
- I'm going to get it!

43:31.400 --> 43:32.234
Ju-kyung.

43:33.736 --> 43:34.778
Are you feeling sick?

43:41.619 --> 43:43.871
You're feverish.
Why didn't you say something?

43:52.796 --> 43:55.341
- I found one!
- Me too!

43:57.176 --> 43:58.344
You call this treasure?

43:58.427 --> 43:59.553
Knowledge is power.

43:59.637 --> 44:02.973
- Okay, 50,000 won is mine.
- Hey, that's my card!

44:03.057 --> 44:03.891
I found one.

44:04.516 --> 44:05.976
- You found one?
- You found it?

44:06.477 --> 44:07.686
Wait, I found one.

44:07.770 --> 44:09.271
- You found one?
- Hey, hold on.

44:11.315 --> 44:13.525
- You know the depth of love
- You know the depth of love

44:13.609 --> 44:15.819
- only in the pain of separation.
- only in the pain of separation.

44:17.071 --> 44:18.238
Goodness.

44:18.322 --> 44:19.323
It's okay.

44:19.406 --> 44:21.325
- Move!
- Hey, where are you going?

44:22.534 --> 44:24.620
- Hey, wait!
- Hey!

44:25.663 --> 44:27.539
I'll let you go over my dead body.

44:27.623 --> 44:29.041
How can I possibly let you go?

44:29.124 --> 44:33.170
If you have to go, if you must go,
fix my heart, you dummy.

44:33.754 --> 44:36.173
Why mention your dead body?

44:38.175 --> 44:40.344
Raise your hand if you love Choi Su-ah.

44:44.973 --> 44:46.934
Raise your hand
if you can't get over Choi Su-ah.

44:47.601 --> 44:49.812
Raise your hand
if you want Choi Su-ah back!

44:50.521 --> 44:51.855
Babe!

45:03.992 --> 45:06.829
Wake up for a second.
I got you some medicine.

45:07.788 --> 45:08.831
Okay.

45:19.258 --> 45:20.843
How did you know?

45:29.101 --> 45:29.935
Take a nap.

45:30.811 --> 45:31.812
Thank you.

45:32.563 --> 45:33.772
Don't be sick.

45:34.940 --> 45:36.650
I hate it when people get sick.

45:47.494 --> 45:49.037
Soo-ho, did you find anything?

45:49.121 --> 45:51.331
Hey Soo-ho, I found the grand prize.

45:51.415 --> 45:52.499
Have you seen Ju-kyung?

45:54.251 --> 45:55.419
Ju-kyung?

46:51.767 --> 46:52.726
You'll wake her up.

46:53.393 --> 46:54.603
Let go.

46:55.479 --> 46:56.522
What if I say no?

46:58.607 --> 46:59.816
Get out.

47:31.139 --> 47:32.558
What? Are they fighting?

47:33.809 --> 47:34.685
You call yourself a human?

47:34.768 --> 47:36.895
Get your eyes checked.
What else do I look like?

47:38.689 --> 47:39.773
You knew I liked her!

47:39.856 --> 47:42.276
Is it first come, first served?
So what if you liked her first?

47:44.069 --> 47:45.070
Are they fighting for real?

47:45.153 --> 47:47.281
- Why does it have to be Lim Ju-kyung?
- I have no idea!

47:47.364 --> 47:48.198
Why it has to be her.

47:49.283 --> 47:50.909
- Give her up!
- Why should I?

47:51.493 --> 47:52.911
What matters is how she feels.

47:59.126 --> 48:00.460
I said, give her up.

48:02.921 --> 48:04.548
That's not something I can control.

48:14.975 --> 48:18.061
Look at my eyebrows!
What are you going to do?

48:18.145 --> 48:20.439
I told you yesterday.

48:20.522 --> 48:23.358
If you go with a darker shade,
they'll look odd for a week.

48:23.442 --> 48:24.776
They will look natural soon.

48:24.860 --> 48:27.237
People are saying
I look like a cartoon character!

48:27.321 --> 48:29.740
Why should I stand
such comments at my age?

48:30.407 --> 48:31.992
I came all the way out to this ditch,

48:32.075 --> 48:33.910
but I should've just
gotten them done in Gangnam!

48:33.994 --> 48:37.247
Give me a refund right away
and fix my eyebrows to how they were!

48:37.331 --> 48:40.125
Then get them done in Gangnam
and not cause a scene in this ditch!

48:40.208 --> 48:41.752
How dare you talk to a customer…

48:52.888 --> 48:55.349
What are you doing?
We're running a business here.

48:55.432 --> 48:57.893
Look what she's done to my brows…

48:58.435 --> 48:59.811
sir.

49:01.271 --> 49:03.899
Come visit us again
if they still look odd in one week.

49:04.691 --> 49:07.736
And if you ever mistreat Hyun-sook again,

49:08.904 --> 49:10.280
I won't let it slide.

49:21.124 --> 49:21.958
Are you all right?

49:24.544 --> 49:25.587
What did you say?

49:26.588 --> 49:27.589
Thank you.

49:29.174 --> 49:30.676
Did you say thank you?

49:31.510 --> 49:33.387
Yes, that's what I said. So what?

49:34.971 --> 49:37.516
You just said thank you to me, right?

49:37.599 --> 49:38.725
Because you're thankful?

49:49.736 --> 49:52.406
Is it first come, first served?
So what if you liked her first?

49:52.489 --> 49:54.241
What matters is how she feels.

50:04.751 --> 50:06.128
Hey, how's this?

50:06.211 --> 50:07.087
What are you doing?

50:07.671 --> 50:09.047
Did you make up with Su-ah?

50:09.131 --> 50:12.384
Ever heard, "You know the depth of love
only in the pain of separation"?

50:12.467 --> 50:14.010
I never knew my love ran so deep.

50:14.094 --> 50:16.054
Three, no, four stories deep…

50:16.680 --> 50:18.515
You still haven't told her how you feel?

50:18.598 --> 50:19.891
Do it today if you can.

50:19.975 --> 50:22.769
Asking someone out works best
if you do it casually…

50:23.937 --> 50:25.397
in a special setting.

50:26.815 --> 50:27.941
Hey, Ju-kyung!

50:28.024 --> 50:30.861
I heard you were sick
and took medicine earlier. Are you okay?

50:30.944 --> 50:32.362
Don't skip your meals.

50:32.446 --> 50:33.780
I feel fine.

50:33.864 --> 50:35.240
I'm going to go.

50:35.323 --> 50:36.575
Stay healthy!

50:38.827 --> 50:43.123
Hey, Tae-hoon!
Are you bothering Soo-ho again?

50:43.206 --> 50:47.586
- He hates you. Take a hint, buddy!
- What are you talking about? Say it right.

50:47.669 --> 50:50.172
- What?
- "What?"

50:50.255 --> 50:51.882
- Are you mocking me?
- "Are you mocking me?"

51:00.056 --> 51:01.558
Why did you set all this up here?

51:01.641 --> 51:04.770
It's just that the moon looks beautiful,

51:04.853 --> 51:06.229
Ju-kyung's away,

51:06.313 --> 51:08.648
and Hee-kyung and Ju-young
won't be back until late,

51:09.441 --> 51:11.651
so I put things together for us.
Take a seat.

51:13.570 --> 51:17.157
Excited about getting complimented
after being scolded for so long, I see.

51:19.201 --> 51:20.660
You made tofu and kimchi?

51:21.453 --> 51:23.038
Remember our first date?

51:23.955 --> 51:25.290
We were in Cheongpyeong

51:25.373 --> 51:27.667
and had rice wine with tofu and kimchi.

51:28.210 --> 51:29.711
You remember all the odd details.

51:30.670 --> 51:33.882
I should have run for the hills.
What was I thinking, falling for you?

51:33.965 --> 51:35.675
I'm paying the price my whole life.

51:36.593 --> 51:38.178
I was wrong to fall for your looks!

51:38.929 --> 51:40.764
You're ruining the mood, seriously.

51:46.436 --> 51:50.440
But still, you were so handsome then.

51:50.524 --> 51:54.194
You were a great singer on top of that,
so how could I not fall for you?

51:54.945 --> 51:56.530
I'm still that person.

51:58.073 --> 52:03.787
You came to me

52:04.454 --> 52:10.126
With a rose between your red lips

52:10.210 --> 52:16.341
I imagined, upon seeing your transparency

52:16.424 --> 52:20.971
If I could empty myself

52:21.054 --> 52:22.848
What's with you today?

52:22.931 --> 52:29.563
I imagined if I could ever be…

52:30.689 --> 52:32.399
held in your eyes.

52:35.819 --> 52:36.653
I'm home…

52:41.408 --> 52:42.242
Get out.

52:48.456 --> 52:49.541
I can't unsee that.

52:50.417 --> 52:52.294
Black bean sauce instant noodles, please.

53:05.140 --> 53:07.517
- Where's the pickled radish?
- Get it yourself.

53:08.101 --> 53:09.394
What? Did you stalk me here?

53:10.312 --> 53:11.396
Whatever.

53:15.567 --> 53:17.485
She even got a part-time job to see me?

53:18.194 --> 53:19.362
I can respect that.

53:25.535 --> 53:27.454
Here, go ahead.

53:28.663 --> 53:32.959
I usually never exchange numbers,
but I'll make this an exception.

53:36.796 --> 53:37.756
Are you crazy?

53:37.839 --> 53:39.883
Why would you ask me to take your picture?

53:44.137 --> 53:47.474
- About time you clocked out, right?
- Yes, I'll see you tomorrow.

53:48.058 --> 53:51.603
She couldn't possibly have thought
I would ask for her number.

53:51.686 --> 53:52.896
That must be it.

53:53.939 --> 53:57.067
Lim Ju-young, how are you so handsome?

53:57.859 --> 53:59.027
What are you doing?

54:36.147 --> 54:38.024
Let's give a round of applause!

54:38.108 --> 54:40.610
Next is a performance of strength
by Team Rainbow!

54:40.694 --> 54:42.779
Please welcome them with loud applause!

54:47.158 --> 54:48.994
What is he pulling with his mouth?
What's he doing?

54:49.077 --> 54:50.829
A car? It's a bicycle car!

54:52.872 --> 54:53.957
So strong.

54:54.541 --> 54:55.375
Success!

54:57.627 --> 54:59.129
It's a bigger one!

55:07.762 --> 55:09.764
He pops it a little later. What an expert!

55:22.277 --> 55:24.320
Clap for them to the tune.

55:37.375 --> 55:39.753
These girls are really
giving everything they've got.

55:46.509 --> 55:48.970
The ultimate singer of Saebom High School.

55:50.180 --> 55:53.349
I hear someone used to train
to become a member of a boy band!

55:53.433 --> 55:54.768
Where is he? Raise your hand.

55:54.851 --> 55:57.395
- Here!
- Many already know about him!

55:58.104 --> 55:59.105
What is this?

55:59.189 --> 56:02.358
He looks very handsome
and has an aura about him.

56:02.442 --> 56:03.276
We can't let him be.

56:03.359 --> 56:06.488
- How did he know?
- How far did the news spread?

56:06.571 --> 56:09.324
- Don't act up.
- Sit down.

56:09.407 --> 56:10.408
We just can't let him be.

56:10.492 --> 56:12.160
Come up to the stage! Applause!

56:12.243 --> 56:13.203
It was you, wasn't it?

56:13.286 --> 56:15.830
You're a great singer.
Sing us a song, please?

56:15.914 --> 56:17.540
- Just this once.
- I'm not doing it.

56:17.624 --> 56:19.250
Are you really not going to sing?

56:19.793 --> 56:22.337
Let me hear you sing, come on!

56:22.420 --> 56:25.131
Han Seo-jun!

56:25.215 --> 56:29.928
- Han Seo-jun!
- Han Seo-jun!

56:30.011 --> 56:31.971
- You want to hear me sing?
- Of course.

56:32.055 --> 56:33.306
Is it because you're shy?

56:34.140 --> 56:37.227
- Go on. Hurry up!
- Then you owe me a favor.

56:37.310 --> 56:39.729
Seriously, you're just like Lim Ju-young.

56:40.355 --> 56:41.189
All right.

56:41.272 --> 56:43.024
I do you a favor if you sing on stage.

56:47.570 --> 56:49.447
You're amazing!

56:59.499 --> 57:01.167
So dreamy.

57:01.251 --> 57:05.880
You and I, underneath the starry night

57:05.964 --> 57:11.427
It makes me new and warm

57:11.511 --> 57:15.348
Your eyes, your smile

57:15.431 --> 57:18.560
I'll remember it forever

57:20.603 --> 57:25.108
My heart is full of you
I grow more like you

57:25.191 --> 57:30.738
A present for me
More beautiful than a dream

57:30.822 --> 57:34.451
Let's spend this endless night

57:34.534 --> 57:38.121
In each other's arms

57:38.830 --> 57:44.043
I want to give you all my days

57:44.127 --> 57:48.923
I want you to know how I feel

57:49.007 --> 57:53.720
The sleepless blue winds

57:53.803 --> 57:57.974
Brightly illuminate this night

57:58.057 --> 58:03.313
- I wonder if you know
- Where are you going, Limju?

58:03.396 --> 58:08.193
My greatest happiness
Is spending regular days with you

58:08.276 --> 58:13.072
You are a light in my world

58:13.156 --> 58:19.496
Stay by my side, just as you are

58:28.379 --> 58:29.339
Hey, Ju-kyung!

58:30.298 --> 58:31.257
Ju-kyung.

58:32.509 --> 58:35.595
Can you give this to Soo-ho for me?

58:35.678 --> 58:37.305
What? Me?

58:37.388 --> 58:38.681
Okay, listen up.

58:38.765 --> 58:41.809
Walk straight southeastward.
He'll be walking along the stream.

58:42.852 --> 58:43.770
My goodness.

58:45.230 --> 58:47.607
I need to use the restroom. Sorry.

58:47.690 --> 58:49.526
You need to give me his jacket.

58:49.609 --> 58:50.610
That's right.

59:02.330 --> 59:03.498
Soo-ho!

59:04.207 --> 59:05.542
Go straight southeastward…

59:05.625 --> 59:06.459
No.

59:06.543 --> 59:08.294
You go straight to the northwest.

59:08.378 --> 59:09.837
Ju-kyung will be by the stream.

59:11.548 --> 59:13.007
Wish you luck, buddy.

59:16.010 --> 59:17.220
Don't be too moved.

59:45.415 --> 59:46.249
Hey, Soo-ho.

59:59.512 --> 01:00:00.346
Hey, Ju-kyung.

01:00:01.347 --> 01:00:02.640
What are you doing out here?

01:00:02.724 --> 01:00:05.310
- Well…
- Have you seen Soo-ho?

01:00:06.144 --> 01:00:06.978
Soo-ho?

01:00:07.061 --> 01:00:08.896
You still haven't told her how you feel?

01:00:08.980 --> 01:00:10.106
Do it today, if you can.

01:00:12.567 --> 01:00:14.485
I think I saw him going that way earlier.

01:00:15.445 --> 01:00:17.280
Wait, isn't that Soo-ho's?

01:00:17.363 --> 01:00:18.197
What?

01:00:19.365 --> 01:00:21.909
Tae-hoon wanted me to take this to him.

01:00:21.993 --> 01:00:24.037
He did? Then I'll give it to him.

01:00:29.667 --> 01:00:30.501
Sure.

01:00:31.127 --> 01:00:32.587
You should give it to him.

01:00:34.088 --> 01:00:35.340
It's the right thing to do.

01:00:36.966 --> 01:00:38.217
I heard he's by the stream.

01:00:38.301 --> 01:00:39.927
Is he? Head inside and rest.

01:00:48.728 --> 01:00:49.562
Ju-kyung.

01:00:55.777 --> 01:00:57.862
Don't you forget about doing me a favor.

01:01:01.741 --> 01:01:02.617
How was it?

01:01:03.826 --> 01:01:05.578
You said you wanted to hear me sing.

01:01:08.706 --> 01:01:09.540
Why?

01:01:10.041 --> 01:01:11.250
Was it that moving?

01:01:11.918 --> 01:01:12.960
I get it.

01:01:13.044 --> 01:01:15.046
Many have cried after hearing me sing.

01:01:16.172 --> 01:01:17.632
But you don't have to cry too.

01:01:23.763 --> 01:01:26.099
Hey, what's wrong?

01:01:31.145 --> 01:01:32.355
What is it?

01:01:33.147 --> 01:01:34.023
What do you mean?

01:01:34.107 --> 01:01:35.775
Ju-kyung asked me to bring this to you.

01:01:36.442 --> 01:01:38.236
- She asked you?
- Yes.

01:01:40.780 --> 01:01:43.116
Hey, you need to take your jacket.

01:01:47.954 --> 01:01:50.248
Hey, you dropped this.

01:02:10.476 --> 01:02:11.519
What is it?

01:02:14.105 --> 01:02:15.481
Are you still feeling sick?

01:02:16.816 --> 01:02:17.900
I'm sorry.

01:02:19.318 --> 01:02:21.320
I don't know what it is,
but it's all my bad.

01:02:22.947 --> 01:02:23.781
Why…

01:02:25.158 --> 01:02:27.410
Why doesn't Soo-ho like me?

01:02:33.166 --> 01:02:34.834
- I…
- Don't say it.

01:02:34.917 --> 01:02:36.002
Actually…

01:02:36.085 --> 01:02:37.503
I said, don't say it.

01:02:38.171 --> 01:02:39.630
I like Soo-ho.

01:02:41.340 --> 01:02:43.217
I told you not to say it.

01:02:43.301 --> 01:02:45.344
I thought I'd be okay,

01:02:47.263 --> 01:02:48.765
but it hurts a little.

01:02:58.024 --> 01:03:01.027
Keep this a secret. Okay?

01:03:04.113 --> 01:03:06.407
Then you should have
kept it a secret from me too.

01:03:08.326 --> 01:03:09.285
Let me see you.

01:03:13.456 --> 01:03:16.083
You look ugly when you cry.

01:03:17.335 --> 01:03:18.169
Come on.

01:03:40.858 --> 01:03:41.692
Leave it.

01:03:41.776 --> 01:03:43.194
You'll erase my makeup.

01:04:11.180 --> 01:04:13.266
Why did I make a show of myself by crying?

01:04:14.433 --> 01:04:16.227
I hope the talent show isn't over yet.

01:04:16.310 --> 01:04:18.312
I should reapply
before the others get back.

01:04:22.525 --> 01:04:24.193
You said you weren't avoiding me.

01:04:26.362 --> 01:04:27.280
Did you cry?

01:04:28.614 --> 01:04:29.448
Why?

01:04:30.199 --> 01:04:31.242
Because of Seo-jun?

01:04:33.536 --> 01:04:35.121
Why are you crying over him?

01:04:36.622 --> 01:04:37.874
Is it because you like him?

01:04:40.418 --> 01:04:42.420
- What?
- Do you like Seo-jun?

01:04:43.004 --> 01:04:44.755
- Why do you care?
- Answer me!

01:04:45.631 --> 01:04:46.757
What's up with you?

01:04:47.758 --> 01:04:50.386
Why is it your business
whether I cried or who I like?

01:04:51.721 --> 01:04:55.057
Why do you keep confusing me
when you like someone else?

01:04:56.559 --> 01:04:57.643
What do you mean?

01:04:57.727 --> 01:04:59.270
You like Su-jin.

01:05:00.646 --> 01:05:03.274
So why would you be nice to me
and make me nervous and…

01:05:08.154 --> 01:05:09.155
Ju-kyung,

01:05:10.114 --> 01:05:12.158
I think there's been a misunderstanding…

01:05:14.452 --> 01:05:16.329
- I did it!
- I know, of course…

01:05:17.038 --> 01:05:18.372
I don't have makeup on.

01:05:18.456 --> 01:05:19.498
Darn it.

01:05:27.715 --> 01:05:29.926
- It's the Ugly Ghost!
- The Ugly Ghost!

01:05:31.010 --> 01:05:33.262
- A ghost!
- You're so busted.

01:05:33.346 --> 01:05:34.555
Get that Ugly Ghost!

01:05:34.639 --> 01:05:35.514
Get it!

01:05:36.182 --> 01:05:38.225
- Get it!
- Wait up!

01:05:45.149 --> 01:05:48.194
- Catch that Ugly Ghost!
- Catch it!

01:05:48.277 --> 01:05:49.570
Go get it!

01:05:56.202 --> 01:05:57.954
Why are they chasing me?

01:05:58.037 --> 01:05:59.121
What do I do?

01:06:21.018 --> 01:06:22.103
Go down!

01:06:23.229 --> 01:06:25.523
- Hey, where is it?
- Let's go down there!

01:06:27.233 --> 01:06:29.694
- Hurry up!
- Let's catch it!

01:06:33.531 --> 01:06:35.157
- It's over there!
- Down there!

01:06:40.413 --> 01:06:41.789
I don't like Su-jin.

01:06:44.542 --> 01:06:45.793
The person I like…

01:06:45.876 --> 01:06:46.961
There it is!

01:06:48.754 --> 01:06:49.714
is you.

01:07:50.733 --> 01:07:53.611
THANK YOU TO WOO HYUN
FOR HIS SPECIAL APPEARANCE

01:08:15.674 --> 01:08:22.681
EPILOGUE

01:08:25.434 --> 01:08:29.230
Here's one who doesn't judge
a book by its cover.

01:08:34.944 --> 01:08:36.695
No one from our school is around, right?

01:08:36.779 --> 01:08:39.532
- Get down.
- Do we really have to do this?

01:08:39.615 --> 01:08:41.283
I just feel a bit shy.

01:08:41.367 --> 01:08:42.868
Why are you getting a part-time job?

01:08:42.952 --> 01:08:45.037
To pay for beauty school.

01:08:45.121 --> 01:08:47.289
I could find a job for you.

01:08:47.373 --> 01:08:49.333
- I'm really bad, aren't I?
- No.

01:08:49.834 --> 01:08:51.127
You're awful beyond imagination.

01:08:51.877 --> 01:08:54.338
I brought you here to show you something.

01:08:56.465 --> 01:08:57.883
I like Lee Soo-ho.

01:09:00.261 --> 01:09:02.263
Lim Ju-kyung, let's end things between us.

01:09:04.306 --> 01:09:09.061
Subtitle translation by: Sun-young Ahn
